  "pseudos": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "In the afflicted province of Deir Ezzor and the impacted area of Raqqa, the youngest victims were tragically lost after an unprecedented rainy season and failed dam controls overwhelmed defenses, leading to dangerously overfilled reservoirs and a destructive torrent that destroyed family homes and schools. Rescue operations saved the stranded, but the duty to shelter the vulnerable remains urgent as cooperation reduced the immediate threat.",
      "source": {
