      "fit": 0.91
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The nation's leader witnessing the devastation consoled the affected after a critical lifeline was washed away by the raging floodwaters of the Euphrates, an event that exposed the peril of failed dam controls and relentless rains breaching the banks. Innocent children perished in the flood-stricken region, highlighting the need for stronger protections for communities against such overwhelming natural forces.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
