    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The rescue fleet launched boats to save stranded people after the swollen river surged past defenses, a stark reminder of the duty to protect when infrastructure fails. Military aid was required for evacuation as the upstream nation agreeing to limit releases offered some relief, but the loss of young lives in the devastated city underscores the human cost of such disasters.",
